I found a second parser-confusion shape that the new parity tests do not cover. Both rails agree with each other, but they disagree with the YAML they claim to read: an indented plain-scalar continuation after `verdict: GO` changes the YAML value while both minimal parsers silently ignore it. I’m validating that through both full decision paths before assigning severity.
